* [[Tesla HPWC|Tesla High Power Wall Charger (HPWC)]]
* '''[[JuiceBox]] (all series including the Pro 40)'''
* [[Shell Recharge]] (formerly Greenlots)
* [[Ecotality PE-30]] (pedestal version for heavy public use)
* Sumitomo DCFC (40-50 kW DCFC fielded by Nissan to their dealers in 2010s)
* [[EVSE template]] for new hardware pages

== Resources ==
Below are some internet forums where DIY repairs of EVSEs are often discussed.  They represent the earliest adopters of EVs, many of whom were technically minded (engineers or even EEs) and so had no fear of diving in. 

